  "solution": "$$A_B = \\vec{A}\\cdot\\hat{B} = \\frac{\\vec{A}\\cdot\\vec{B}}{|\\vec{B}|} = \\frac{3 + 4}{\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{7}{\\sqrt{2}}$$",
